---
作者: Derek
题目: To Lean:
日期: Wed Jul 21 22:48:24 1999
whisper     策反敌将  is to decrease enemy cities' NPC's loyalty and when
their loyalty reach pretty low, they will leave their position and become a
free officer.
Then, you can do "searchwise  搜索贤人".  When you see a free officer
available, you can do this job to ask them to settle in your city. (use "help
boy" to locate NPC in that city).  and when they come to your city, you have
to do "visitwise   访问贤人 " job to make them an officer in your city.
Then more NPC you have in your city, the faster your city will improve.  and
if you don't have any NPC as officer in your city, your city also would drop,
include popullation, harvest.
and the other jobs like "letter      送信 ' can increase your skills.  
"fanpeople   煽动百姓    " just like its name is to create riot in others city
and it will lower the safty .
"  patrol      巡逻      and   visitpeople 体察百姓   " are to increase safty
for the city.
alos, you can read "help localmeeting, help localbuy, help localsuggestion"


yanmenguan is now under your hand, you can do anything you want.
addoil to all...


